            <div class="styled-list"><h2>Level 2</h2>
<p>Grievance Officer</p>
<p>It is our constant endeavor to resolve customer&#39;s concerns promptly. In case you are not satisfied with the response given to you by our team, you may write to our Grievance Redressal Officer Mr. Jerome Vincent at <a href="mailto:ggro&#64;bajajgeneral.com">ggro&#64;bajajgeneral.com</a></p>
<h2>Level 3</h2>
<p>Head Customer Service</p>
<p>if you are still not satisfied with the solutions provided, or have some feedback for us,<br />
write to <a href="mailto:head.customerservice&#64;bajajgeneral.com">head.customerservice&#64;bajajgeneral.com</a></p>
<p>If after having followed the above steps, your issue remains unresolved, you may approach the Insurance Ombudsman for Redressal.</p>
<p>Login to  <a href="https://www.cioins.co.in/Ombudsman">https://www.cioins.co.in/Ombudsman</a> to get details on Insurance Ombudsman Offices.</p>
</div>
            
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

